## Risk Class Requirements

| Risk Class | Min Evidence | Root Cause Confidence | Recovery Envelope | Independent Verification | Adversarial Verification | Resilience Verification | Explicit Auth |
|------------|--------------|----------------------|-------------------|-------------------------|-------------------------|------------------------|---------------|
| R0 (routine) | E2 | probable_cause | No | Optional | Conditional | Conditional | No |
| R1 (standard) | E3 | observed_cause | Yes | Recommended | Conditional | Conditional | Yes |
| R2 (high) | E3 | confirmed_root_cause | Yes | Required | Required | Conditional | Yes |
| R3 (critical) | E3 | confirmed_root_cause | Yes | Required | Required | Required | Yes |

## Evidence Levels

- **E0** (claim): Assertion without corroborating evidence
- **E1** (static_evidence): Code/config/policy inspection
- **E2** (reproduced): Observed behavior under controlled conditions
- **E3** (production_path): Actual affected execution path exercised
- **E4** (adversarial): Boundary/hostile/forged conditions tested
- **E5** (independent): Fresh verifier evaluates scoped evidence

## Retry Policy

- Default retry budget: 0
- Retry budget must be explicit
- Each retry requires new treatment plan
- Changed evidence invalidating diagnosis requires re-diagnosis
- Rollback/safe checkpoint required before retry
- R3: Each retry requires fresh operator authorization
